/* Welcome Guide: .kachat and Message Requests */
"To chat with someone, press Create Chat and enter their Kaspa address or .kachat name. Your first message reaches them as a Message Request they can accept. For the most privacy, turn on Private Chat: nothing links you on chain, and they see your messages once they start a private chat with you too." = "要和某人聊天，点击“创建聊天”，输入对方的 Kaspa 地址或 .kachat 名称。你的第一条消息会作为消息请求送达，对方可以接受。想要最高隐私，请开启私密聊天：链上没有任何东西把你们联系在一起，对方也和你开始私密聊天后就能看到你的消息。";
"50 Kaspa is recommended to get started - enough to claim a .kachat name and chat for a while. 5 Kaspa is enough for about 2500 messages." = "建议先准备 50 Kaspa——足够领取一个 .kachat 名称并聊上一阵子。5 Kaspa 大约可发送 2500 条消息。";
"Your public messaging identity. Fund it with a small amount to pay message fees and for your .kachat name - never send money here that you intend to spend." = "你的公开消息身份。存入少量资金用于支付消息费用和 .kachat 名称——切勿把打算花掉的钱发到这里。";
"Nextcloud is off while Testnet is on." = "测试网开启时，Nextcloud 处于关闭状态。";
"Backups, sync, media and calls through Nextcloud work on mainnet only, so testnet can never overwrite your mainnet backup. Turn off Testnet in Settings > Connection and your Nextcloud connection comes back as it was." = "通过 Nextcloud 的备份、同步、媒体和通话仅在主网可用，因此测试网绝不会覆盖你的主网备份。在“设置 > 连接”中关闭测试网，Nextcloud 连接就会恢复原样。";
"Live on Testnet: names, prices and payments here use TKAS on testnet-10. Mainnet names come after an audit." = "已在测试网上线：这里的名称、价格和付款都使用 testnet-10 上的 TKAS。主网名称将在审计后推出。";
